<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Student guide | ICSS</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/style.css"></head><body><header class="top"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="mark">IC</span><div><b>ICSS MARKET</b><small>STUDENT GUIDE</small></div></a><a href="/">Home</a></header><main class="wrap page narrow"><p class="eyebrow">STUDENT HANDBOOK</p><h1>Rules of engagement</h1><section class="challenge-detail"><ol><li>Create your own student account.</li><li>Inspect public metadata such as <code>/robots.txt</code> as the first recon exercise.</li><li>Complete the ten OWASP learning modules.</li><li>Submit flags to earn points.</li><li>Submit a report with evidence, impact, and remediation.</li></ol><p>Only test the assigned training lab. Do not scan production ICSS services, third-party systems, or other students' accounts. All shop purchases are simulated and no real payment is collected.</p></section></main><footer>ICSS WAPT CTF</footer></body></html>
